[showinfo] Todo: No done tasks
[showinfo] Todo: Select a task first
[showwarning] Todo: Already on the list
window "Todo"
  Entry ""
  Button "Add"
  Checkbutton "Hide done" [ ]
  Listbox [[x] x | [ ] x]
  Button "Done"
  Button "Clear done"
  Label "1 open, 1 done"
